# Figma Web NP PDP — UI law (non-negotiable)

UI-learning SoT for **web** NP PDP. Full forensic dump: `design-system/np-pdp-web-ui-learning.md`.

## Sources of truth (re-measure; do not invent)

1. Page: `Web / Homepage / NP / PDP` (`3414:11591`)
2. Left stack: `3399:12459` (23 section cards)
3. Share/Save: `3422:4581`
4. First fold set: `3767:5699`
5. Sister components on page **PDP** (Tabs, Chips, Amenities, Rating, Floor plan cards, Cards, etc.)

If CSS / Housing live / mobile frame disagree with these IDs → **web Figma wins for web work**.

## Hard bans

- **Do not** make Share/Save/Back **circles** (`radius/full`, 50%, pill-as-circle).
- **Do not** copy **mobile** chrome (`4678:13581` = 40×40, **no** stroke) onto **web** Share/Save.
- **Do not** set outer **section cards** to radius **16** or pad **16** — outer is always radius **24** (**web only**).
- **Do not** invent colors/radii/type outside Bricks + measured Google Sans Flex roles.
- **Do not** treat the web template’s 23-section list as Housing URL content authority (`figma-housing-url-sections-only`).
- **Do not** apply this web rounded-section recipe to **mobile** frames — mobile outer sections are **flat** (`figma-np-pdp-mobile-ui`).

