## Share / Save — WEB Recipe W (only for web)

Measured `3422:4581`:

| Prop | Required |
|---|---|
| Hit target | **42×42** |
| Pad | **12** all |
| Radius | **`radius/m` (12)** — rounded square |
| Fill | `surface/white` |
| Stroke | **`border/default` 1px** |
| Row gap | **16** |
| Glyph | ~18×18; Iconography — Bricks |

Mobile Recipe A stays in `figma-button-chrome.mdc` (40×40, no stroke). **Never merge.**

## Section cards (left 792 column)

| Prop | Required |
|---|---|
| Fill | `surface/white` |
| Radius | **24** all |
| Gap | **24** |
| Pad A | **[24,24,24,24]** (default) |
| Pad B | **[24,0,24,0]** (edge-bleed carousel/table only) |
| Title | Google Sans Flex **SemiBold 18** / h**26** / `text/primary` |

Inner nested cards (floor plan / property cards) may use radius **16** — **outer section shell may not**.

