## Type roles (do not freestyle)

- Section H1 (in-page): SemiBold **18**
- Modal/panel header: Medium **16**
- Body: Medium/Regular **14** (primary), captions **12**
- CTA: Medium **14**
- Family: **Google Sans Flex** only on this surface

## Nested card widths (when using kit components)

- Floor plan card: **320**
- Property card: **280**, outer radius **16**, image top radius 16
- Rating inner block: radius **16**, `surface/subtle`

## Mandatory verify before shipping web UI

```
Share/Save: 42×42, radius===12 (token m), fill surface/white, stroke border/default
Section outer: radius===24, fill surface/white, gap===24, title SemiBold 18
First fold: pad 24, radius 24, gap 40, surface/white
No radius/full on icon chrome
```

Fail → fix against SoT IDs before other work.

